      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need help with something weird. ever since that accident at the lab during my internship (i was near the beamline when the shielding glitched) i've been seeing these colored streaks in my vision. like if something bad is about to happen there's this heavy red fog in my peripheral vision. it's not like a hallucination though because it actually predicts stuff before it happens. is there any scientific way to explain why i'm seeing probability densities like this?",
