    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the doctors just keep trying to pathologize it as a disease. they dont get that it's more like an upgrade or a heightened sense. if i'm seeing these things, they have to be based on something real. like, if the particles shifted my perception to track high-probability outcomes before they collapse into certainty, wouldn't that actually make sense in a quantum field theory context? are there any specific subatomic interactions or field theories that would support a biological sensor for probability density?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
